# Cloudflare Pages routing.
#
# /api is never served from this origin: VITE_API_URL points the built app at
# the Railway API, and scripts/verify-pages-build.mjs refuses to publish a
# bundle that does not embed that origin. There is deliberately no /api guard
# here: Pages resolves unknown GETs to the SPA shell before _redirects runs
# (a `/api/* 404` line silently never fires), and a Pages Function in this
# environment fails the deploy (Cloudflare's upload validation imports
# node:stream), so the build-time guard is the only one that works.
#
# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback: every other path serves the app shell,
# routing is handled client-side by React Router.
